<UserControl x:Class="AstroNucleaus.Wpf.Views.RProcessView"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
             xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
             xmlns:vm="clr-namespace:AstroNucleaus.Wpf.ViewModels"
             xmlns:controls="clr-namespace:AstroNucleaus.Wpf.Controls"
             xmlns:views="clr-namespace:AstroNucleaus.Wpf.Views"
             mc:Ignorable="d" d:DesignWidth="1300" d:DesignHeight="850"
             d:DataContext="{d:DesignInstance Type=vm:RProcessViewModel}">
    <UserControl.Resources>
        <ResourceDictionary>
            <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
                <ResourceDictionary Source="/AstroNucleaus.Wpf;component/Themes/Tables.xaml" />
            </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>

            <Style x:Key="InputLabel" TargetType="TextBlock">
                <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold" />
                <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,12,0,6" />
            </Style>
            <Style x:Key="Hint" TargetType="TextBlock">
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextSecondaryBrush}" />
                <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12" />
                <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,4,0,0" />
                <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap" />
            </Style>
            <Style x:Key="StatValue" TargetType="TextBlock">
                <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="20" />
                <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold" />
                <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,4,0,0" />
            </Style>
            <Style x:Key="StatLabel" TargetType="TextBlock">
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextSecondaryBrush}" />
                <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12" />
                <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap" />
            </Style>
        </ResourceDictionary>
    </UserControl.Resources>

    <DockPanel Margin="8,20,8,12">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Top" Margin="0,0,0,14">
            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}" Text="r-Process" />
            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SecondaryText}" Margin="0,4,0,0" FontSize="14"
                       Text="Rapid neutron capture: full reaction network at constant temperature and neutron density, then freeze-out and β decay." />
        </StackPanel>

        <Grid>
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="310" MinWidth="270" />
                <ColumnDefinition Width="12" />
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

            <!-- Inputs -->
            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="18,14">
                <DockPanel>
                    <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Bottom" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                        <Button Style="{StaticResource PrimaryButton}" Tag="&#xE768;" Content="Run r-process" Command="{Binding RunCommand}" />
                        <Grid Margin="0,10,0,0" Visibility="{Binding IsBusy, Converter={StaticResource Visibility}}">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ProgressBar Height="6" Value="{Binding Progress}" IsIndeterminate="{Binding IsProgressIndeterminate}" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                            <Button Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource IconButton}" Width="26" Height="26" FontSize="11"
                                    Content="&#xE711;" ToolTip="Cancel" Command="{Binding CancelCommand}" />
                        </Grid>
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Status}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,8,0,0" FontSize="12">
                            <TextBlock.Style>
                                <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                                    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextSecondaryBrush}" />
                                    <Style.Triggers>
                                        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasError}" Value="True">
                                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource ErrorBrush}" />
                                        </DataTrigger>
                                    </Style.Triggers>
                                </Style>
                            </TextBlock.Style>
                        </TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                        <StackPanel Margin="0,0,14,0">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE9E9;" Margin="0,0,10,0" />
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CardTitle}" Text="Conditions" />
                            </StackPanel>

                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource InputLabel}" Text="Temperature (GK)" />
                            <DockPanel>
                                <TextBox DockPanel.Dock="Right" Width="72" Margin="10,0,0,0"
                                         Text="{Binding TemperatureGK, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus, StringFormat=0.##}" />
                                <Slider Minimum="0.5" Maximum="3" Value="{Binding TemperatureGK}" IsSnapToTickEnabled="True" TickFrequency="0.05"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                            </DockPanel>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Text="{Binding KTText}" />

                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource InputLabel}" Text="Neutron density, log₁₀(n_n / cm⁻³)" />
                            <DockPanel>
                                <TextBox DockPanel.Dock="Right" Width="72" Margin="10,0,0,0"
                                         Text="{Binding Log10NeutronDensity, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus, StringFormat=0.#}" />
                                <Slider Minimum="16" Maximum="32" Value="{Binding Log10NeutronDensity}" IsSnapToTickEnabled="True" TickFrequency="0.5"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                            </DockPanel>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Text="{Binding NeutronDensityText}" />

                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource InputLabel}" Text="Duration (s)" />
                            <DockPanel>
                                <TextBox DockPanel.Dock="Right" Width="72" Margin="10,0,0,0"
                                         Text="{Binding DurationSeconds, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus, StringFormat=0.##}" />
                                <Slider Minimum="0.1" Maximum="5" Value="{Binding DurationSeconds}" IsSnapToTickEnabled="True" TickFrequency="0.1"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                            </DockPanel>

                            <Expander Header="Advanced" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                                <StackPanel Margin="0,4,0,0">
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource InputLabel}" Text="Network up to Z" />
                                    <ComboBox ItemsSource="{Binding MaxZOptions}" SelectedItem="{Binding MaxZ}" />
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Text="Matter decaying beyond is counted as lost (no fission)." />
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource InputLabel}" Text="Decay after freeze-out (years)" />
                                    <TextBox Text="{Binding DecayYears, UpdateSourceTrigger=LostFocus}" />
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Text="Seed: ⁵⁶Fe." />
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Expander>

                            <Border Height="1" Background="{StaticResource DividerBrush}" Margin="0,18,0,8" />
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Icon}" Text="&#xE8B7;" Margin="0,0,10,0" />
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CardTitle}" Text="Nuclear data" />
                            </StackPanel>

                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource InputLabel}" Text="Reaction rates (REACLIB)" />
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Text="{Binding ReaclibText}" Margin="0,0,0,6" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource SecondaryButton}" Tag="&#xE896;" Content="Download REACLIB" Command="{Binding DownloadReaclibCommand}"
                                    ToolTip="JINA REACLIB default snapshot 2025-03-30, as distributed with pynucastro on GitHub (18.7 MB)" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource SecondaryButton}" Tag="&#xE838;" Content="Load REACLIB file…" Command="{Binding ImportReaclibCommand}"
                                    Margin="0,8,0,0" />
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Hint}"
                                       Text="Download: REACLIB default library (2025-03-30) from the pynucastro repository on GitHub. Or load another snapshot from reaclib.jinaweb.org." />

                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource InputLabel}" Text="Masses" />
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Text="{Binding MassTableText}" Margin="0,0,0,6" />
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                                <Button Style="{StaticResource SecondaryButton}" Tag="&#xE838;" Content="Load mass table…" Command="{Binding ImportMassTableCommand}" />
                                <Button Style="{StaticResource IconButton}" Content="&#xE74D;" ToolTip="Remove the theoretical mass table"
                                        Command="{Binding RemoveMassTableCommand}" Height="36" Width="36" />
                            </StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Text="Theoretical table (FRDM2012, HFB-24, …): lines 'Z A mass-excess(MeV)'. It fills nuclides AME2020 does not list." />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </ScrollViewer>
                </DockPanel>
            </Border>

            <!-- Results -->
            <Grid Grid.Column="2">
                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                    <RowDefinition Height="*" />
                </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                <UniformGrid Rows="1" Columns="4">
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="16,12" Margin="0,0,10,0">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource StatLabel}" Text="Neutrons captured per seed" />
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource StatValue}" Text="{Binding NeutronsPerSeedText}" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="16,12" Margin="0,0,10,0">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource StatLabel}" Text="Mean A: freeze-out → decayed" />
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource StatValue}" Text="{Binding MeanAText}" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="16,12" Margin="0,0,10,0">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource StatLabel}" Text="Waiting points" />
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource StatLabel}" Text="{Binding WaitingPointsText}" Foreground="{StaticResource TextPrimaryBrush}"
                                       FontSize="14" Margin="0,6,0,0" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="16,12">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource StatLabel}" Text="Lost beyond max Z" />
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource StatValue}" Text="{Binding LostText}" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                </UniformGrid>

                <TabControl Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource PageTabControl}" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                    <TabItem Header="Path" Tag="&#xE80A;">
                        <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="12,10">
                            <DockPanel>
                                <ItemsControl DockPanel.Dock="Bottom" ItemsSource="{Binding Warnings}" Margin="4,6,0,0">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding StringFormat=⚠ {0}}" Foreground="{StaticResource WarningBrush}" FontSize="12" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl>
                                <views:NuclidePlaybackView DataContext="{Binding Playback}" />
                            </DockPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </TabItem>

                    <TabItem Header="Abundances" Tag="&#xE9D2;">
                        <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="16,12,16,8">
                            <DockPanel>
                                <DockPanel DockPanel.Dock="Top" Margin="0,0,0,8">
                                    <Button DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource IconButton}" Content="&#xE896;"
                                            ToolTip="Export abundances as CSV" Command="{Binding ExportCsvCommand}" />
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CardTitle}" Text="Abundance per mass number" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                </DockPanel>
                                <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Bottom" Text="{Binding ConditionsText}" Style="{StaticResource Hint}" Margin="0,8,0,0" />
                                <controls:MassChainPlot Chains="{Binding Chains}" />
                            </DockPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </TabItem>

                    <TabItem Header="Table" Tag="&#xE80A;">
                        <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="6">
                            <DockPanel>
                                <CheckBox DockPanel.Dock="Top" Margin="8,4,0,6" Content="Only abundances above 10⁻⁶" IsChecked="{Binding SignificantOnly}" />
                                <DataGrid Style="{StaticResource TableGrid}" ItemsSource="{Binding TableRows}">
                                    <DataGrid.Columns>
                                        <DataGridTextColumn Header="Nuclide" Binding="{Binding Nuclide}" Width="80" />
                                        <DataGridTextColumn Header="Z" Binding="{Binding Nuclide.Z}" Width="45" />
                                        <DataGridTextColumn Header="N" Binding="{Binding Nuclide.N}" Width="50" />
                                        <DataGridTextColumn Header="Y freeze-out" Binding="{Binding AtFreezeOut, StringFormat=0.###E+00}" Width="110" />
                                        <DataGridTextColumn Header="Y decayed" Binding="{Binding Decayed, StringFormat=0.###E+00}" Width="110" />
                                        <DataGridTextColumn Header="T½(β) s" Binding="{Binding BetaHalfLifeSeconds, StringFormat=0.###E+00}" Width="110" />
                                        <DataGridTextColumn Header="S_n (MeV)" Binding="{Binding NeutronSeparationMeV, StringFormat=0.000}" Width="*" />
                                    </DataGrid.Columns>
                                </DataGrid>
                            </DockPanel>
                        </Border>
                    </TabItem>

                    <TabItem Header="Model &amp; data" Tag="&#xE946;">
                        <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="20,16">
                            <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CardTitle}" Text="Model" />
                                    <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,8,0,0" LineHeight="21"><Run Text="Full network from the ⁵⁶Fe seed up to the chosen Z at constant T and n_n for the given time. Each nucleus captures neutrons at λ(n,γ) = n_n·N_A⟨σv⟩/N_A, is photodisintegrated at λ(γ,n) and β⁻-decays (also with delayed neutrons). Then all neutron reactions stop (freeze-out) and the products decay."/><LineBreak/><LineBreak/><Run Text="λ(γ,n) follows from detailed balance with the neutron separation energy S_n = ME(Z,A−1) + ME(n) − ME(Z,A):  λ(γ,n) = 9.8686·10⁹·T9^{3/2}·(2·g(A−1)/g(A))·((A−1)/A)^{3/2}·exp(−11.6045·S_n/T9)·N_A⟨σv⟩(n,γ), with g = 2J+1 of the ground states. Where a mass is missing, the REACLIB reverse rate is used."/><LineBreak/><LineBreak/><Run Text="The implicit (backward Euler) system is solved exactly element by element: (n,γ)/(γ,n) form a tridiagonal system along each isotopic chain, and β decays only move matter to higher Z."/><LineBreak/><LineBreak/><Run Text="Not included: fission and fission recycling, α decay, β⁺/EC, charged-particle reactions, neutrons released by delayed emission, excited-state partition functions, and the drop of T and n_n during expansion."/></TextBlock>

                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CardTitle}" Text="Data" Margin="0,20,0,0" />
                                    <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,8,0,0" LineHeight="21"><Run Text="Reaction rates: JINA REACLIB (Cyburt et al., ApJS 189, 240 (2010)). “Download REACLIB” takes the default library snapshot of 2025-03-30 from the pynucastro repository on GitHub (reaclib.jinaweb.org itself blocks automated downloads); “Load REACLIB file…” takes any snapshot you downloaded in your browser. Masses: AME2020 (Wang et al., Chin. Phys. C 45, 030003 (2021)) and your theoretical table. Spins: NUBASE2020 (Kondev et al., Chin. Phys. C 45, 030001 (2021)). AME2020 and NUBASE2020 are downloaded from the IAEA Atomic Mass Data Center."/><LineBreak/><LineBreak/><Run Text="{Binding DataText, Mode=OneWay}" Foreground="{StaticResource TextSecondaryBrush}" /></TextBlock>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </ScrollViewer>
                        </Border>
                    </TabItem>
                </TabControl>
            </Grid>
        </Grid>
    </DockPanel>
</UserControl>
